# Subscription Flow

> **Source:** `lib/server/subscription-activation.ts`, `app/api/subscriptions/xendit/route.ts`

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Seller views plans] --> B[Selects plan]
    B --> C[POST /api/subscriptions/xendit]
    C --> D{Has active sub?}
    D -->|No| E[Create invoice SUB-*]
    D -->|Yes| F[Upgrade/Downgrade logic]
    E --> G[Xendit invoice created]
    G --> H[Payment page]
    H --> I{Payment?}
    I -->|Paid| J[Xendit webhook]
    I -->|Failed/Expired| K[Subscription stays inactive]
    J --> L{SUB-* prefix?}
    L -->|Yes| M[activateSubscriptionPaid]
    M --> N{Status check}
    N -->|trial/active/expired| O[Set status=active]
    N -->|cancelled| P[Reactivate]
    O --> Q[Set period start/end]
    Q --> R[Update umkm_profiles]
    R --> S[Notification to seller]
    K --> T{Retry?}
    T -->|Yes| H
    T -->|No| U[Cancel subscription]

    style S fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff
    style U fill:#F44336,color:#fff
```

---

## Subscription Status

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> trial: Free trial (7 days)
    trial --> active: Payment successful
    trial --> expired: Trial ends without payment
    active --> active: Renewal (new period)
    active --> cancelled: Seller cancels
    active --> expired: Payment fails
    cancelled --> active: Reactivation (new payment)
    expired --> active: Renewal payment
```

