|------|------------|-----------|-------------|----------|
| Free | Rp 0 | Rp 0 | 5 | Basic |
| Basic | Rp 50,000 | Rp 500,000 | 50 | + Analytics |
| Pro | Rp 150,000 | Rp 1,500,000 | Unlimited | + Priority, API access |

